Kubernetes


first search this webside

install minikube-------> select https://minikube.sigs.k8s.io › docs › start------>start minikube--------->in here the details will be there

What you’ll need
2 CPUs or more
2GB of free memory
20GB of free disk space
Internet connection


launch instance 

launch ---------->name:minikube--------->c7i-flex-large----->keypair-------->jenkins security group--------> 20ebs volume----> launch

yum install docker -y && systemctl start docker

curl -LO https://github.com/kubernetes/minikube/releases/latest/download/minikube-linux-amd64
sudo install minikube-linux-amd64 /usr/local/bin/minikube && rm minikube-linux-amd64

minikube version


install kubectl

https://kubernetes.io › docs › tasks › tools------->install tools

Install kubectl on Linux

curl -LO "https://dl.k8s.io/release/$(curl -L -s https://dl.k8s.io/release/stable.txt)/bin/linux/amd64/kubectl"


